edits_description = "The background was removed and the image was recolored."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_h6dpt")
province = 54
blurb = "Depicts [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fujiwara_no_Hidesato]Fujiwara no Hidesato[/url], a Heian-period folk hero, being attacked by Ōmukade, a giant centipede yōkai.

The scene comes from the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tawara_T%C5%8Dda_Monogatari]Tale of Tawara Tōda[/url]. According to this legend, Hidesato was asked by a giant serpent to avenge the killer of her offspring. He found the centipede at Mount Mikami, shot two ineffective arrows, but the third arrow smeared with his saliva proved lethal."
